messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 988627 and 705861? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 988627 and 705861, we can use the standard addition algorithm. We start by aligning the numbers by their place values, with the ones place aligned, the tens place aligned, and so on. Then, we add the digits in each column, starting from the rightmost column (the ones place) and moving to the left. If the sum of the digits in a column is greater than 9, we carry over the extra digit to the next column. .\n\nLet's perform the addition step by step:.\n\n```.\n  988627.\n+ 705861.\n---------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the rightmost column (the ones place):.\n\n```.\n  7.\n+ 1.\n-----.\n  8.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the tens place:.\n\n```.\n  2.\n+ 6.\n-----.\n  8.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the hundreds place:.\n\n```.\n  6.\n+ 8.\n-----.\n  14.\n```.\n\nSince 14 is greater than 9, we carry over the extra digit (1) to the thousands place and write down 4 in the tens place:.\n\n```.\n  4.\n+ 8.\n-----.\n  14.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the thousands place:.\n\n```.\n  8.\n+ 5.\n-----.\n  13.\n```.\n\nAgain, since 13 is greater than 9, we carry over the extra digit (1) to the ten-thousands place and write down 3 in the thousands place:.\n\n```.\n  3.\n+ 5.\n-----.\n  13.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the ten-thousands place:.\n\n```.\n  8.\n+ 0.\n-----.\n  8.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the hundred-thousands place:.\n\n```.\n  8.\n+ 7.\n-----.\n  15.\n```.\n\nSince 15 is greater than 9, we carry over the extra digit (1) to the millions place and write down 5 in the hundred-thousands place:.\n\n```.\n  5.\n+ 7.\n-----.\n  15.\n```.\n\nFinally, we move to the millions place:.\n\n```.\n  9.\n+ 7.\n-----.\n  16.\n```.\n\nSince 16 is greater than 9, we carry over the extra digit (1) to the ten-millions place and write down 6 in the millions place:.\n\n```.\n  6.\n+ 7.\n-----.\n  16.\n```.\n\nNow, we have the final sum:.\n\n```.\n  988627.\n+ 705861.\n---------.\n 1694488.\n```.\n\nTherefore, the sum of 988627 and 705861 is 1694488.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
