messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 410103 and 112983? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 410103 and 112983, we can use the standard addition algorithm. Here's how it works:.\n\n1. Write down the numbers one below the other, aligning them by their place values (ones, tens, hundreds, etc.).\n2. Start adding from the rightmost digit (the ones place) and move to the left.\n3. If the sum of any column is greater than 9, carry over the extra digit to the next column to the left.\n4. Continue this process until all columns have been added.\n\nLet's perform the addition:.\n\n```.\n  410103.\n+ 112983.\n---------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the rightmost digit:.\n\n- 3 + 3 = 6 (no carry).\n- 0 + 8 = 8 (no carry).\n- 1 + 9 = 10 (write down 0 and carry over 1).\n- 1 + 2 = 3 (add the carried over 1 makes it 4).\n- 0 + 1 = 1 (no carry).\n- 1 + 1 = 2 (no carry).\n- 4 + 1 = 5 (no carry).\n\nSo, the sum is:.\n\n```.\n  410103.\n+ 112983.\n---------.\n 523086.\n```.\n\nTherefore, the sum of 410103 and 112983 is 523086.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
