messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 746869 and 982828? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 746869 and 982828, we can use the standard addition algorithm. Here's how it works:.\n\n1. Write down the numbers one below the other, aligning them by their place values (ones, tens, hundreds, etc.).\n2. Start adding from the rightmost digit (the ones place) and move to the left.\n3. If the sum of any column is greater than 9, carry over the extra digit to the next column to the left.\n4. Continue this process until all columns have been added.\n\nLet's perform the addition:.\n\n```.\n  746869.\n+ 982828.\n---------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the rightmost digit:.\n\n- 9 + 8 = 17 (write down 7 and carry over 1).\n- 6 + 2 + 1 (carry over) = 9.\n- 8 + 8 = 16 (write down 6 and carry over 1).\n- 6 + 2 + 1 (carry over) = 9.\n- 4 + 8 = 12 (write down 2 and carry over 1).\n- 7 + 9 + 1 (carry over) = 17 (write down 7 and carry over 1).\n\nNow, we have carried over 1 to the next column, so we add it there:.\n\n- 1 + 0 = 1.\n\nPutting it all together, we get:.\n\n```.\n  746869.\n+ 982828.\n---------.\n 1729697.\n```.\n\nSo, the sum of 746869 and 982828 is 1729697.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
