messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 770156 and 866951? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 770156 and 866951, we can use the standard addition algorithm. We start by aligning the numbers by their place values, with the ones place aligned, the tens place aligned, and so on. Then, we add the digits in each column, starting from the rightmost column (the ones place) and moving to the left. If the sum of the digits in a column is greater than 9, we carry over the extra digit to the next column. .\n\nLet's perform the addition step by step:.\n\n```.\n  770156.\n+ 866951.\n---------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the rightmost column (the ones place):.\n\n```.\n  6.\n+ 1.\n-----.\n  7.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the tens place:.\n\n```.\n  5.\n+ 5.\n-----.\n  0.\n```.\n\nWe carry over the 1 to the hundreds place.\n\n```.\n  1.\n  5.\n+ 9.\n-----.\n  14.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the hundreds place:.\n\n```.\n  1.\n  1.\n+ 6.\n-----.\n  17.\n```.\n\nWe carry over the 1 to the thousands place.\n\n```.\n  1.\n  7.\n+ 6.\n-----.\n  13.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the thousands place:.\n\n```.\n  1.\n  0.\n+ 9.\n-----.\n  19.\n```.\n\nWe carry over the 1 to the ten-thousands place.\n\n```.\n  1.\n  7.\n+ 6.\n-----.\n  19.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the ten-thousands place:.\n\n```.\n  1.\n  7.\n+ 6.\n-----.\n  19.\n```.\n\nFinally, we move to the hundred-thousands place:.\n\n```.\n  1.\n  7.\n+ 6.\n-----.\n  19.\n```.\n\nWe carry over the 1 to the millions place.\n\n```.\n  1.\n  7.\n+ 6.\n-----.\n  19.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the millions place:.\n\n```.\n  1.\n  7.\n+ 6.\n-----.\n  19.\n```.\n\nWe carry over the 1 to the ten-millions place.\n\n```.\n  1.\n  7.\n+ 6.\n-----.\n  19.\n```.\n\nFinally, we move to the ten-millions place:.\n\n```.\n  1.\n  7.\n+ 6.\n-----.\n  19.\n```.\n\nSo, the sum of 770156 and 866951 is 1637107.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
